  "limitations": [
    "No potency value for CHEMBL5426285 is predicted or supplied; the retrieved IC50s are for other compounds and are not estimates for the query compound.",
    "HASPIN kinetic parameters (ATP Km, substrate identity/concentration, enzyme linear range) are not in the packet; enzyme_concentration, substrate_concentration, ATP_concentration, and reaction_time are unresolved pending pilot experiments.",
    "Retrieved assay descriptions state 'HASPIN (unknown origin)' for several examples, so species/construct comparability to human Q8TF76 is unverified.",
    "Biochemical inhibition establishes enzyme-level activity only; it does not demonstrate cellular target engagement or viability effects, and cellular observations would not by themselves establish HASPIN-specific causality.",
    "If CHEMBL5426285 is ATP-competitive, the measured IC50 depends on the chosen ATP concentration; IC50 at [ATP]=Km should be reported for comparability.",
    "Compound solubility at 30 µM in 1% DMSO is unverified; a solubility/precipitation check is required before the run."
  ]
}
